OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman, 22,     
OL,4,Araped in Glasgow park                  
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a woman  
OL,7,Fwas raped in a Glasgow park, police    
OL,8,Fhave said.                             
OL,10,FThe 37-year-old was arrested in        
OL,11,Fconnection with the serious sexual     
OL,12,Fassault of a 22-year-old woman at about
OL,13,F23:50 on Friday near to the bridge from
OL,14,FKelvin Walkway.                        
OL,16,FThe woman had been walking through the 
OL,17,Fpark when the incident took place and  
OL,18,Fan appeal was later released by police.
OL,20,FFollowing the arrest, Police Scotland  
OL,21,Fsaid inquiries remained ongoing.       
